  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "jane.irwin@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>MAHWAH, N.J.,&nbsp;March 30, 2017&nbsp;/PRNewswire/ -- Stryker Orthopaedics unveiled today its first-ever digital series titled &quot;Road Trip to a Healthier Lifestyle.&quot; Pro Football Hall of Famer and Stryker brand ambassador, Jerome Bettis joins PGA TOUR Professional and GetAroundKnee® recipient Fred Funk on a cross country journey documented in 3-episodes filmed in Miami, FL, Dallas, TX, and New York, NY.</p>\n<p>The series will feature both Stryker brand ambassadors demonstrating various ways to stay mobile and active by engaging in healthy activities that are relatable to everyone. The teaser released today marks the official debut of the series, which will live on <a href=\"http://www.strykerchallenge.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.StrykerChallenge.com</a> throughout the year.<br>\n</p>\n<p><b>Read the full Annual Review:</b></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/stryker-orthopaedics-announces-road-trip-to-a-healthier-lifestyle-digital-content-series-featuring-jerome-bettis-and-fred-funk-300431554.html\" target=\"_blank\">PRNewswire</a></p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jun 01 2017 17:26:47 GMT-0400",
